flowchart TD
  IMG["Image"] --> MS["Multi-scale VQ tokenizer<br/>token maps 1×1, 2×2, 4×4 … 16×16"]
  MS --> S1["Predict the 1×1 map"]
  S1 --> S2["Predict the 2×2 map<br/>given all coarser maps"]
  S2 --> S3["… each scale in one parallel pass"]
  S3 --> SK["Final 16×16 map"]
  SK --> DEC["Decoder → image<br/>about 10 forward passes in all"]
